  "intro": [
    "Every Bedrock Agent control-plane operation the emulator advertises, and what",
    "Emuplane does with it. The service is REST/JSON on `/agents`, `/knowledgebases`,",
    "`/flows`, `/prompts` and `/tags`, and there is no console action. All four Bedrock",
    "planes sign with the `bedrock` credential scope, so the path picks the plane; agents",
    "carry versions, aliases, action groups, collaborators and knowledge-base associations."
